0 Cap with long brownish hairs. C. up to 55(65) mm broad. V. absent. Stipe often very long. Sp. 12-18(20) x 6,5- 9,5(10) µm, germ pore eccentric. Ch. 20-80 x 7-20 µm. Soil, leaf litter, pieces of wood.01131360 Parasola conopileus (FR.) ÖRSTADIUS & E. LARSS.40
