0 (7) Spores up to 17 (20) µm  long. C. up to 25 mm broad, during drying often pinkish. V. scanty. L.edge mostly pigmented. Spores 12-17 (20) x 6-9 µm , often apically prolonged. Pl. 35-65 (80) x 10-17,5 (20) µm . Ch. (25)35-65 (70) x 7,5-17,5 µm , clavate marginal cells near the margin of c. very numerous. Soil. 08171920220 P. prona (FR.) GILLET ss. ÖRSTADIUS 200
